Scope: Settings fills the full available window stage; preserve sidebar chat reservation and existing Settings controls/scrolling.
Cause: App.solve_ui passes conversation_layout.height (a sidebar-only dock, roughly45%windowheight) to Scene.settings_page_layout, which subtracts it from both Settings widget height and page frame. This produces the blank lower area in the operator screenshot.
Fix: Settings no longer accepts a sidebar dock height. Its widget and bounded local frame use window height below title/header only; sidebar chrome continues receiving its dock normally.
